-- The 13 Nov inventory shows it still sends only the anon key, and maytapi-send-group accepts it only through the legacy lane. If the flag is removed first,
-- the dispatcher would stop sending. It uses the same helper: select pg_temp.cutover_job('maytapi-send-group-poll');  (needs its own approval).
